
# The abstract view handle: what `withNativeEnv` reaches for an env with no `view` of its own (`javascript`, `shared`).
# Opaque and `dynamic`, since no backend can say what it holds. The backends that can define their own beside it
# (node/view, memory/view, browser/view, toolkit/view), and the build bears the one for its target through ../view.

form view
  link handle, like dynamic, mark private
